            <ArticleTitle>Critical pathway experience at Cedar-Sinai Medical Center.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>1063-8</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Critical pathways provide an excellent tool for promoting multidisciplinary efforts to develop optimal, cost-competitive plans for managing patient care. The pharmacy department can play a variety of roles in developing and implementing critical pathways. In advocating optimal drug selection and monitoring, pharmacists can help their institutions reduce costs while maintaining or improving quality of care.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
